              `--ii  _p_r_o_g'  allows you to specify a program _p_r_o_g to run whenever
              files in a module are committed.  _p_r_o_g runs with a single  argu‐
              ment,  the  full  pathname of the affected directory in a source
              repository.   The `commitinfo', `loginfo', and `editinfo'  files
